pkg.description:
C3 application package this Type System element _belongs_ to; note that this maybe different from the package
where this type-system element was declared.

@see #package

restriction.description:
If the variable reference has a restriction, that will limit the types that can be bound.
For example: `type Foo<X: Mammal>` can only be bound to a type that `isA(Mammal)`.

@see Type#isA
